{"id": "69467", "title": "渣受作死手册", "author": "江水遥", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69467.htm", "intro": "秦非觉得当初自己一定是脑抽了，才去招惹江宁的。\r\n要不然一向横着走的秦大少怎么就吃了这么多哑巴亏？\r\n甚至连屁股都没保住......\r\n偏偏那个江宁吃干抹净后，还咂巴着嘴说：“你这是自找的，作死！”\r\n妈的，老子就作死了怎么着？\r\n老子作死也得拉着你陪葬！\r\n本文讲述的是一个极品渣受如何作死的故事。\r\n这也是一个极品渣攻如何被逼成忠犬的故事。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69467", "chapters": [{"title": "哟，极品帅哥！", "file": "10634306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "见一次硬一次", "file": "10634307.html", "available": false}, {"title": "秦变态的攻势", "file": "10634308.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强吻一个！", "file": "10634309.html", "available": false}, {"title": "珍爱生命，远离直男", "file": "10634310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "你求我啊！", "file": "10634311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再吻一个！", "file": "10634312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "传说中的失恋", "file": "10634313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "两回亲嘴儿的交情", "file": "10634314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别闹，小宁", "file": "10634315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "传说中的约会", "file": "10634316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一起回家", "file": "10634317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "秦渣渣", "file": "10634318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "你硬了", "file": "10634319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "憋久了不好", "file": "10634320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "作死第一发", "file": "10634321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "作死第二发", "file": "10634322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相处", "file": "10634323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "同居什么的", "file": "10634324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "接吻什么的", "file": "10634325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "好上了？", "file": "10634326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "咱俩的关系", "file": "10634327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "不能再惯着江宁了", "file": "10634328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谁上谁下的问题", "file": "10634329.html", "available": false}, {"ti